  "topic": "包豪斯 1919–1933",
  "facts": [
    {
      "fact_id": "F001",
      "claim": "包豪斯由瓦尔特·格罗皮乌斯于1919年4月1日在魏玛创办，由萨克森大公美术学院与萨克森大公工艺美术学校合并而成。",
      "source_title": "Bauhaus — Wikipedia (en)",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bauhaus",
      "classification": "external",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-10-24"
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F002",
      "claim": "1919年4月的包豪斯宣言（四页）开篇写道：“Das Endziel aller bildnerischen Tätigkeit ist der Bau!”（一切造型活动的最终目标是建筑！）",
      "source_title": "Cathedral (title page) by Lyonel Feininger for Walter Gropius's Bauhaus Manifesto and Program, April 1, 1919 — German History in Documents and Images",
      "source_url": "https://germanhistorydocs.org/en/weimar-germany-1918-1933/cathedral-title-page-by-lyonel-feininger-for-walter-gropius-bauhaus-manifesto-and-program-april-1-1919.pdf",
      "classification": "external",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-10-24"
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F003",
      "claim": "宣言封面是费宁格的立体主义木刻《大教堂》，最初题为《社会主义大教堂》。",
      "source_title": "Lyonel Feininger, Cathedral — MoMA Collection",
      "source_url": "https://www.moma.org/collection/works/63072",
      "classification": "external",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-10-24"
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F004",
      "claim": "包豪斯三阶段：魏玛 1919–1925，德绍 1925–1932，柏林 1932–1933。",
      "source_title": "Bauhaus — Wikipedia (en)",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bauhaus",
      "classification": "external",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-10-24"
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F005",
      "claim": "三任校长：格罗皮乌斯 1919–1928，汉内斯·迈耶 1928–1930，密斯·凡德罗 1930–1933。",
      "source_title": "Bauhaus — Wikipedia (en)",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bauhaus",
      "classification": "external",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-10-24"
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F006",
      "claim": "1919年首批教员为伊顿、费宁格、马克斯与格罗皮乌斯；施莱默与克利1920年加入，康定斯基1922年加入。",
      "source_title": "Bauhaus — Wikipedia (en)",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bauhaus",
      "classification": "external",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-10-24"
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F007",
      "claim": "伊顿（任期1919.10.1–1923.3.31）主持预备课程并任多数工坊的形式导师；学生须通过预备课程才能选择工坊进入主课程。",
      "source_title": "Johannes Itten's preliminary course — Bauhaus Kooperation",
      "source_url": "https://bauhauskooperation.de/en/knowledge/the-bauhaus/training/preliminary-course/johannes-ittens-preliminary-course",
      "classification": "external",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-10-24"
    },
    {
