      "claim": "伊顿1923年离开后，莫霍利-纳吉重写预备课程，并与约瑟夫·阿尔伯斯共同主持。",
      "source_title": "Josef Albers's preliminary course — Bauhaus Kooperation",
      "source_url": "https://bauhauskooperation.de/en/knowledge/the-bauhaus/training/preliminary-course/josef-alberss-preliminary-course",
